3cbr\u003eThe service is quite fast and attentive because people are waiting outside, although they don't rush us to finish our lunch.\u003cbr\u003eAll the dishes are very tasty and excellent, the portions are not bad.\u003cbr\u003eThe lobster fettuccine is excellent, very flavorful.\u003cbr\u003eThe coconut chicken is different  and good too.\u003cbr\u003eThe Green curry fried rice is very delicious.\u003cbr\u003eAll the dishes in this restaurant are very tasty and the prices are reasonable, no wonder the restaurant is so crowded. I'm not crazy about Thai cuisine, but this one is not really traditional Thai to me, so I really liked it. We will come back here next time we visit our daughter.","While visiting NY, our daughter wanted to have lunch with our niece at a Thai restaurant, I and my wife just followed. It's a very crowded place and people are waiting for a long time. We had to wait so I went to get some coffee. No drinks …",1,[[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"What did you get?",[[[["E:LUNCH"],"Lunch",2]],1],null,null,"Meal type",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"How much did you spend per person?",[[[["E:USD_30_TO_40"],"$30–40",2,null,"$30 to $40"]],1],null,null,"Price per person",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"Food",null,null,null,"Food",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"Service",null,null,null,"Service",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"Atmosphere",null,null,null,"Atmosphere",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"How long did you wait for a table?",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_10_TO_30_MIN"],"10-30 min",2]],1],null,null,"Wait time",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3]],null,"",null,1,[],"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google",[null,null,"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png"],null,null,1],5,5,[],[8114,"",null,3]],[null,5,["2 months ago",null,"17