A7pZoXgwOauF8I8eHepRXwncfHWXhk5J27gHN5Fw_u675RUQofGX3FABOCE4yX_ucfZNFasJBBcOGZDT9IDA-TTXDAyAoUhq1-CH8d\u003dk-no","Mussels Frites","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhCGunutoMg-1b4SfsLPPl0x\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhCGunutoMg-1b4SfsLPPl0x",1.3333333333333333,null,"4 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLewTCRVqRU3p5LusBfza9iyzquNrDeR1kAgBWUEVwO4qztbZAxwYhuwApRynLRGVzHM0rGe5NZRXUiDauYUiMBEHinYsoBPfvWzSZt9AsWZTT0SHN7ckfcCe1N1Giegn7Zz9r_M0Rf_Dznr\u003dk-no","Crispy Snapper Raad Prik","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhBSln3RQlDHWSnGF_JRcEVa\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhBSln3RQlDHWSnGF_JRcEVa",1.3333333333333333,null,"4 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfAOhTYFE8HTlJwfD0wyEhIuyVJ5QH7_TmvdG9hhNox5lraFKi5BvvIuR4qU83xFI4hFK-Ohw49PcWYfDLcc6Z3HSSQ4-oEMixkWzDQDQIfhGFlVd1U6KyCIHju9DxgAal3wriljBffJuU\u003dk-no","Uncle Boons Famous Coconut Sundae","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhAvyCtlaQxTgAdxJabD0jmL\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhAvyCtlaQxTgAdxJabD0jmL",1.3033333333333332,null,"4 months ago"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"en","If you ever loved Uncle Boons, Thai Diner will definitely feel familiar—but it doesn’t quite hit the same highs. Service was fast and attentive, which set a great tone, but the food ended up being pretty hit or miss. The som tum salad was a standout and easily one of the best things on the menu—bright, balanced, and genuinely exciting. The crab fried rice had excellent texture and plenty of fresh crab, but the flavor just didn’t have that same depth Boons used to deliver.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe mussels and fries were a mixed bag: fries were perfectly seasoned and crisp, and the mussels were clean, but the sauce felt one-note and the sweet pickled onions threw the whole dish off. The fried snapper was cooked well but leaned overly sweet—I’d definitely order the sauce on the side next time so it doesn’t overpower everything. The accompanying rice was a miss: under-seasoned, mushy, and mixed with large pieces of herbs and cucumbers that didn’t quite work due to the texture of the rice. The spicy tamarind margarita also skewed too sweet.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThat said, the coconut sundae was incredible and honestly worth coming back for on its own. Overall, I’d come back for the nostalgia (and dessert).","If you ever loved Uncle Boons, Thai Diner will definitely feel familiar—but it doesn’t quite hit the same highs. Service was fast and attentive, which set a great tone, but the food ended up being pretty hit or miss. The som tum salad was a …",1,[[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"What did you get?",[[[["E:DINNER"],"Dinner",2]],1],null,null,"Meal type",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"How much did you spend per person?",[[[["E:USD_90_TO_100"],"$90–100",2,null,"$90 to $100"]],1],null,null,"Price per person",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"How would you describe the noise level?",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_MODERATE"],"Moderate noise",2]],1],null,null,"Noise level",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"How long did you wait for a table?",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"No wait",2]],1],null,null,"Wait time",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3]],null,"",null,1,[],"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google",[null,null,"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png"],null,null,1],5,5,[],[8114,"",null,3]],[null,5,["3 months ago",null,"1781712733198"],["Mayeku Aggrey","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwIr2S8UYi7S4vLyAt9YVicLPoNW250CyYM0KKZFvoxkk2tA\u003ds64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105220171160504347880/reviews?hl\u003den-IN",4,13,[null,1]],null,"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psVmQwTlFVMWhzTTFCakxVUmhVVTB5YVVkZmFsRRAB",null,null,null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psVmQwTlFVMWhzTTFCakxVUmhVVTB5YVVkZmFsRRAB\u0026d\u003d286732336\u0026t\u003d1\u0026wv\u003d1",null,"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psVmQwTlFVMWhzTTFCakxVUmhVVTB5YVVkZmFsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjlVd0NQU1hsM1BjLURhUU0yaUdfalE%7C%7C?hl\u003den-GB",null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLes3AhGqLwaqyrRvg4P5UB3oE5oYhZiBRZoc38_cEVpN0CIFNIsVvBmo6H4QUSGAJxgh6xhcWOaAvdlxjDZC13x-fCIVEdZfHiaxLASHOtVDAv60PgNUMGku23_OAQ6rEliBPc1WXXyGY5p\u003dk-no","","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhCFoZ_Xfx6DeLU-YUk1NWLn\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhCFoZ_Xfx6DeLU-YUk1NWLn",1.3333333333333333,null,"3 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfATsxfEoCDLsug0Wezp0rRv2Us0tdt7YdDkY-wGWpQ87KFKV_qrP_AuOipCNDuwlK70cgMKO_dBNZr7HP03ewZTIaH0a4hMjxgUbmSre91Pg3vmEYCHb1HT-EKLdl3LARwaBysj1PfeMk\u003dk-no","","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhB0OG1aVf2WVRNmsN4PwnvL\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhB0OG1aVf2WVRNmsN4PwnvL",1.3333333333333333,null,"3 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeTA5dAKzI3cQjC5lmJYtptChBhOiiV-kV_QBTbllYuXuf24XvGd96rPpeSTM3d7SXywbxdv40maTL3q-0HvhQwcBV3dzhP8GYdQKa14wu1W_wRfev62YQhDhKZJ_nTMGewBOMmA8a58gA\u003dk-no","","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhDmFzaZ5Clmi8lh7Pa3KMTu\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhDmFzaZ5Clmi8lh7Pa3KMTu",1,null,"3 months ago"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"en","I ended up at Thai Diner after wandering around Nolita for a while and looking for somewhere that felt casual but memorable. The place was busy without feeling chaotic, and once the food started arriving I understood why people keep coming back. I started with the khao soi, which came out steaming hot with a rich curry broth and noodles that somehow stayed perfectly textured all the way through the meal. It was comforting without feeling heavy.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI also ordered the Thai disco fries because they sounded too interesting to pass up. They were crispy underneath and covered with a flavorful curry sauce that made them disappear much faster than expected. The chicken satay had a nice char from the grill and paired well with the peanut sauce, while the roti was soft and perfect for scooping up every bit of curry left on the plate.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat I liked most was that nothing felt overly complicated. The flavors were bold but approachable, and every dish felt like something you would happily order again. By the end of the meal I was already looking around at other tables wondering what I should try next time.","I ended up at Thai Diner after wandering around Nolita for a while and looking for somewhere that felt casual but memorable. The place was busy without feeling chaotic, and once the food started arriving I understood why people keep coming …",1,[[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"What did you get?",[[[["E:DINNER"],"Dinner",2]],1],null,null,"Meal type",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"How much did you spend per person?",[[[["E:USD_60_TO_70"],"$60–70",2,null,"$60 to $70"]],1],null,null,"Price per person",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"Food",null,null,null,"Food",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"Service",null,null,null,"Service",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"Atmosphere",null,null,null,"Atmosphere",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"What size group is this place best suited for?",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 person",2],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 people",2],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_THREE_TO_FOUR"],"3-4 people",2]]],null,"Group size",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"How long did you wait for a table?",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"No wait",2]],1],null,null,"Wait time",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_VEGETARIAN_OPTIONS_TIPS"],"Vegetarian options",null,null,null,"Vegetarian options",null,null,null,null,["There are several vegetarian-friendly dishes available, including curry-based items, noodle dishes, vegetable sides, and tofu substitutions. Vegetarians should have no trouble putting together a full meal here.",""],null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS_TIPS"],"Dietary restrictions",null,null,null,"Dietary restrictions",null,null,null,null,["The kitchen is generally accommodating when asked about ingredients. If you have allergies or dietary concerns, it is worth mentioning them before ordering since many dishes can be adjusted.",""],null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"How is the parking here?",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_SOMEWHAT_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"Somewhat difficult to find parking",2]],1],null,null,"Parking space",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_TIPS"],"Tell others about parking",null,null,null,"Parking",null,null,null,null,["Like most of Lower Manhattan, street parking can be difficult. Public transportation or rideshare is often the easier option.",""],null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_KID_FRIENDLINESS_TIPS"],"Kid-friendliness",null,null,null,"Kid-friendliness",null,null,null,null,["Families do visit, although younger children who prefer simpler flavors may have a smaller selection to choose from.",""],null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_ACCESSIBILITY_TIPS"],"Wheelchair accessibility",null,null,null,"Wheelchair accessibility",null,null,null,null,["The restaurant is generally accessible, though space can feel a bit tight during busy service periods.",""],null,null,3]],null,"",null,1,[],"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google",[null,null,"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png"],null,null,1],5,5,[],[8114,"",null,3]],[null,5,["5 months ago",null,"1777443670787"],["Shannon Carrasco","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_ObvQerrLWwtFbZerxbPVuGvK47LAGqmvxoUM5DNh8li5XdNm\u003ds64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103540303148988695368/reviews?hl\u003den-IN",19,19,[null,1]],null,"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xrNVQyTTJORVl5VWtwT1pIUTViR1ZVV1d0VFNrRRAB",null,null,null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xrNVQyTTJORVl5VWtwT1pIUTViR1ZVV1d0VFNrRRAB\u0026d\u003d286732336\u0026t\u003d1\u0026wv\u003d1",null,"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xrNVQyTTJORVl5VWtwT1pIUTViR1ZVV1d0VFNrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlk5T2M2NEYyUkpOZHQ5bGVUWWtTSkE%7C%7C?hl\u003den-GB",null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcjPrqWpLjnMbi3Oqvzcf145O7HEVg0I-naEcMR0gMFqnZhgFHbY4Jjbw0OeVcp_lKykKPNlkATm0bwGnKY1KrWtnFb3U4bkoN9DdmmBd16doZYxk6BN2blxSL8S5Rko0Q-llSyZsxKIu4\u003dk-no","Coconut chicken cutlet with green mango salad","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhDPgFsGFV7tolQn9YBLAfz4\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhDPgFsGFV7tolQn9YBLAfz4",1.3333333333333333,null,"5 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLffPIFhmDRQ1VOEse7x4KLCkTB88QR8LTojGCNaQTgabQV80omuhegx4CNn_LSFUDk4YDPiQ-XFxDoeFgVqxqhMXA3_PjcZjFzf_Xnuyq9pDOgn5PFlPUzoD2w5HEK63hGt82i2eSzGD4Ia\u003dk-no","Banana pudding and toasted coconut peanut Icecream ","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhDVTh1vGQXCRL0p5Vcv1lQi\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhDVTh1vGQXCRL0p5Vcv1lQi",1.3333333333333333,null,"5 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfktN2Mz0Q-s1nA_fAhpzMxftCX4OXpb0LGjfCleByHnUaqrqS0OVK8szAOvTlvr0D2NM-WHJzj8R9MQmJoUT59Iot3XXV_a0scYXPNAUQRgG9tGtgvF-BN9DlMUxw24xq0_iZQ-k5bGO-q\u003dk-no","Thai disco fries ","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhANZcpuGm8drZgrt0Q1LQ7d\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhANZcpuGm8drZgrt0Q1LQ7d",1.3333333333333333,null,"5 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeZQxjw_LKn5EszYaouhMnxcULNV4WraOtPRtQDRtpO5C637No6wqa6jIopIhIWRTFYm2LeOjeq5QsM4qUjRxfvcSxRbvmeRZWg3fRBCc1MVAHqr8Oc-LNnw6Xttxq_2vjA_p2QC8rcYVM\u003dk-no","Thai papaya salad and tea","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhCs6pGBcwCRkQlcsk4240nj\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xf8ef42b02bc96daf","CIABIhCs6pGBcwCRkQlcsk4240nj",1.8110047846889952,null,"5 months ago"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"en","I read another post that stated it was one of their top restaurants of the year, and I’d have to agree, it’s mine too. I’m always a little scared to try Thai food because of the spicy plates they typically have on the menu but I decided to take a risk with this one. I had to, it looked so incredible! I’m so glad I did, I was amazed by the freshness and flavors of everything we had! Each and every plate and part of our meal was incredible and I was excited for the next thing to come, and I didn’t want to stop eating! I can’t wait to go back, it’s not close to my house but I’ll make a way to get there again. The service was friendly and attentive, they checked on us so many times, even someone who appeared to be the chef asked about the quality of our meal and if we were enjoying it. Even those who were not our waiter, were there checking and seeing what we needed and if everything was ok. There was a wait when we got there, we didn’t make reservations ahead of time so that is recommended especially in busy times, like taje we went, a Sunday afternoon. But, their system us every organized and the times were accurate that they gave us and even accommodated us as we had a stroller, so they found us a table that would work with that which we appreciated. The interior is a bit kitschy but authentically Thai inspired and so cute, and cozy. The atmosphere is other worldly, as you don’t feel like you’re quite in Manhattan anymore. A nice little Thai getaway for lunch. 😋🤤 We loved it! A must try!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(We were also asked about allergies, which is nice to know as they have tons of peanuts in their dishes. They pay attention to the details!)","I read another post that stated it was one of their top restaurants of the year, and I’d have to agree, it’s mine too. I’m always a little scared to try Thai food because of the spicy plates they typically have on the menu but I decided to …",1,[[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"What did you get?",[[[["E:LUNCH"],"Lunch",2]],1],null,null,"Meal type",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"How much did you spend per person?",[[[["E:USD_40_TO_50"],"$40–50",2,null,"$40 to $50"]],1],null,null,"Price per person",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"Food",null,null,null,"Food",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"Service",null,null,null,"Service",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"Atmosphere",null,null,null,"Atmosphere",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"How would you describe the noise level?",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"Quiet, easy to talk",2]],1],null,null,"Noise level",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"]